        "description": "Route: {{ $labels.http_route }}\nService: {{ $labels.job }}\nEnv: {{ $labels.env }}\nSite: {{ $labels.site_name }}\n\n5xx Error Rate: {{ $values.A.Value }} req/sec\nThreshold: > 0.5 req/sec | Window: 5m",
        "summary": "Fast-burn 5xx on {{ $labels.http_route }} ({{ $labels.job }}) rate={{ $values.A.Value }}req/s"
